                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela mwami wa-Egepita taakwe naakaboola limbi kuzwa kucisi cakwe, nkaambo mwami wa-Babuloni wakazunda nyika yoonse mwami wa-Egepita njaakavubide kuzwa kukalonga ka-Egepita mane kusikila kumulonga Firate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
