        },
        {
          "text": "Joyakini kajisi myaka iili ikumi amusanu aitatu naakaba mwami, nkabela wakeendelezya mu-Jerusalemu myezi yotatwe. Izina lyabanyina kabali Nehusita mwana musimbi wa-Elinatani waku-Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
