          "text": "Mpawo Joyakini mwami wa-Juda wakalyaaba mumaanza aamwami wa-Babuloni, walo abanyina abalanda bakwe abaalu bakwe abasilutwe bakwe, nkabela mwami wa-Babuloni wakamutola mubuzike, Aya akaba mumwaka wamusanu aitatu wabwami bwa-Nebukadinezara. ",
